74yaAVjKyD78-nWKAj393Shs_uw&oe=6B0DC7DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16_Trailer_Cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1650529959559293", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_1650529966225959_6937430513776092703_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wiQobw51KVcQ7kNvwGV0API&_nc_oc=Adq9xxoWrWImIGu5t-Z2_sqiX28ycZMduBSi4jDncP89GCGbFgbrrAxFCUAAw14bftI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR_mElX5KPoU8wObq2FtLo6it2cpwU__W3kU3STRhzd3Q&oe=6B0DC832"}, "display_name": "Survival Arena", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# SURVIVAL ARENA VR\n\nEnter a world of immersive VR survival and combat! Face dangerous enemies, complete challenging missions, earn gold, and grow stronger as you fight your way through five different maps.\n\n## FIVE UNIQUE CHALLENGES\n\n- **Survival Arena:** Fight enemies and survive.\n- **Rescue Mission:** Save and escort survivors to safety.\n- **Base Defense:** Defend a house against three waves of enemies.\n- **Treasure Maze:** Explore a maze and collect treasure chests.\n- **Final Boss:** Defeat a powerful boss and escape.\n\n## FIGHT, EARN AND UPGRADE\n\nUse motion-controlled melee weapons and shields in immersive VR combat. Earn gold through gameplay to purchase better equipment, improve your character's abilities, and unlock new maps.\n\n## FOUR DIFFICULTY LEVELS\n\nChoose Easy, Normal, Hard, or Nightmare. Test your skills, master the combat system, and take on increasingly challenging missions.\n\n## YOUR SURVIVAL STARTS NOW\n\nExplore, fight, upgrade, and overcome every challenge in Survival Arena VR!", "short_description": "Survive five unique VR challenges! Fight enemies, rescue survivors, defend your base, explore dangerous mazes, and battle a powerful boss. Earn gold, upgrade your abilities, unlock weapons and equipment, and conquer four difficulty levels in immersive VR combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "devel